So is this just a modern trend? I checked out trailers[ for] 1981’[s] Raiders of the Lost Ark,[ and] 1964’s Goldfinger[ to get] a bigger picture.[
]Both revealed some well-known scenes[ (]including Goldfinger’s iconic laser and dialogue[),] but the plot basics were instead explained by[ voice]over, rather than any especially huge visual giveaways.
